{
  "id": "u06",
  "number": 6,
  "title": "Family",
  "summary": "Talk about your family, your pets and the things you have, using avoir. Then say whose things they are, and describe people.",
  "canDo": [
    "Say what I, you, he, she, we and they have, using avoir: j'ai, tu as, il a, nous avons.",
    "Name family members and pets, with un, une, le, la or les.",
    "Say my, your and his or her, with the right form for the thing owned.",
    "Describe people and pets, with adjectives in the right place and form: un petit chat, ma mère est gentille."
  ],
  "lessons": [
    {
      "id": "u06-l1",
      "title": "To have",
      "goal": "Say what you and other people have, using the forms of avoir and un or une.",
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": "u06-l1-n1",
          "title": "Avoir: to have",
          "body": "**avoir** means *to have*. Learn its forms as a set: **j'ai**, **tu as**, **il / elle a**, **nous avons**, **vous avez**, **ils / elles ont**. *Je* becomes *j'* before a vowel, so *j'ai* starts with an apostrophe.",
          "examples": [
            {
              "fr": "J'ai un chien.",
              "en": "I have a dog."
            },
            {
              "fr": "Nous avons une voiture.",
              "en": "We have a car."
            },
            {
              "fr": "Ils ont un chat.",
              "en": "They have a cat."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "u06-l1-n2",
          "title": "Un or une after avoir",
          "body": "After **avoir**, use **un** before a masculine noun and **une** before a feminine noun, as in Unit 3: *un chat* (m), *une voiture* (f). Both mean *a*. Keep the article with the noun, as always.",
          "examples": [
            {
              "fr": "Elle a un chat.",
              "en": "She has a cat."
            },
            {
              "fr": "Tu as une voiture ?",
              "en": "Do you have a car? (to a friend)"
            },
            {
              "fr": "Un chien et un chat.",
              "en": "A dog and a cat."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
